Description-en: virtualization library - NSS plugins
 This package is part of the Ubuntu Virtualization Hardware Enablement
 variant, which provides the virtualization stack of future Ubuntu
 releases back to the Ubuntu LTS. The package names are suffixed with
 -hwe in comparison to the equivalent base packages.
 However, some documentation and manual pages may still refer to the base
 package names. In those cases, the base and -hwe package names should
 be considered interchangeable. The -hwe packages can fulfill dependencies
 to the base packages, no package is expected to directly depend on a -hwe
 suffixed package to keep them interchangeable.
 .
 libvirt exposes a long-term stable API that can be used to interact with
